#
# LTP "fs" scenario-group skip list (kirk --skip-file).  One test tag per line; lines
# beginning with '#' and blank lines are ignored.  List tests that fail or break
# for reasons intrinsic to running over NFS (loop/block devices, local-fs-only
# features) so that any remaining TFAIL/TBROK is a real server regression.
#
# Seeded from a memfs baseline run; add an entry with a one-line reason.

# Needs an LTP scratch block device (tst_device: acquires a loop device + mkfs's
# a fresh fs on it to fill) -- irrelevant when the fs under test is the NFS mount;
# TBROK "Failed to acquire device" on every backend.
fs_fill
